    "message": "Our team needs access for more collaborators. I want to compare the available plans before changing anything."
  },
  {
    "message_id": "M06",
    "message": "The invoice names the wrong legal entity. Please tell me how to request a corrected billing document."
  },
  {
    "message_id": "M07",
    "message": "The report preview contains all the figures, but the downloaded PDF cuts off the legend. Can you investigate the export?"
  },
  {
    "message_id": "M08",
